<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-WORLD CLUB CHALLENGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-WORLD CLUB CHALLENGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Super League world</p>
<p>club challenge rugby league matches played on Friday:</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p> Penrith (Australia) 48 Warrington (England)	   12</p>
<p>Pool B</p>
<p> Leeds (England)     22 Adelaide (Australia)	   14</p>
<p> Oldham (England)    20 North Queensland (Australia) 16</p>
</text>
